{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43335","headline":"寒蝉树 · 沈鹏","name":"寒蝉树","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一叶初飞日，寒蝉益易惊。\n入林慙织细，依树媿身轻。\n大干时容息，乔枝或借鸣。\n心由饮露静，响爲逐风清。\n忝有翩翾分，应怜嘒唳声。\n不知微薄影，早晚挂緌缨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈鹏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43335.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43335","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}